{"sections":[{"slug":"广义上同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"广义上同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">广义上同调</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"广义上同调"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">广义上同调</span></strong> (generalized cohomology) <span lang=\"zh\">是空间范畴上满足与普通</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类似的性质的某种反变函子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">每个广义上同调都由一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>:\n$$\r\nE^*X = \\pi_{-*}[\\Sigma^\\infty_+ X,E].\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}